  "text": "## Purpose & Scope  \n### Purpose  \nTo establish complaint handling procedures that:\n- Acknowledge all complaints promptly\n- Investigate issues thoroughly\n- Resolve complaints fairly\n- Report to FCA as required\n- Prevent repeat issues\n- Maintain customer relationship",
